<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\桜3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 800, April. <STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s third-year memorial service was coming up soon. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having lost the man of the house, the Niimura family had moved away to who knew where.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> hadn't told even her best friend <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> where they were going.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\荒田集落イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
With no family of her own, the only place I could think of for <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> to go was the Arata settlement, where <STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s family home was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We had tried somehow to get in touch with Arata before, but nothing much came of it, and we didn't even know where the Arata settlement was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s wedding had also been held in the Arata settlement, but we couldn't attend.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently, by the settlement's <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おきて">rules</STYLE>, outsiders basically weren't allowed in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Instead, a reception for friends was held in Motoki-cho, but not one person from the settlement came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So our only connection to the Arata settlement was <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE>.<PG>
By rights, we were the ones who should go there and pray for <STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro</STYLE>'s soul.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it seemed that wouldn't <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="かな">happen</STYLE> this year either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All we could do was put our hands together right here, the two of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We weren't having <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE> do it, and we hadn't told her the facts either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was far too heavy a burden for <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should we tell her once she's around middle-school age, at least?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\台所1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"How long have </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> known each other again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I asked <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE>, who was making breakfast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Since right after she was born. When my mother took me in for a regular checkup, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had just been born. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s mother died giving birth. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">My mother was looking through the glass at </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, who'd just been carried into the nursery, and it seems that's when she learned what had happened to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s mother. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">We've known each other ever since."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"I see, so you two go back that far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and I had an old friendship we couldn't shake, from high school on, but yours runs a lot deeper than that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. That's why I want to go to the third-year memorial service..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even right after <STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro</STYLE> died, we hadn't been able to attend the memorial service.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"All we can do now is not forget </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and pray for his soul in our hearts. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">That's all we can do, but we mustn't forget to do it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> aside, <STYLE ID="9">Haruka-chan</STYLE> was on my mind too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Haruka-chan</STYLE> is our own daughter by blood. We may have given her up for adoption, but there's no way I couldn't worry about her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"All right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I'm off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Do what your teacher says, and be a good, proper elementary schooler!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Okaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE> saw me off at the front door as I left for work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From today, <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE> was an elementary schooler―today was her school's entrance ceremony.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was cherry-blossom season, though. Would she manage to get to school all right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
When I opened the front door, the outside air blew in for just a moment.
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE2" "2000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hmm? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, don't ride in the company car today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">All right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. I absolutely won't ride in the company car."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s so goood!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE> seemed to be feeling well today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had to stay out of the wind as much as possible, but <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> would see to that properly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\作業机.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At the office, it was another day of prototyping a new phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the design, through choosing the parts, it becomes a real object, even if only a prototype.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As always, when the finished thing worked properly, it moved me.<PG>
Well, prototype or not, this time it was only a change to the earlier device's design, so no big machinery or full-scale prototype was needed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The semiconductors could be reused too, so as long as I fit the machinery neatly into the <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="きょうたい">casing</STYLE>, it would be fine.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"All right, that'll do."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The prototype was working to spec.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All that was left was to humor the client's demands.<PG>
The seat next to mine had been empty for nearly 2 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE> used to sit here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">He</STYLE> and I had known each other since high school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And after graduating, as friends who couldn't shake each other, we joined the same company.<PG>
"<STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE>, we gotta head out soon."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My junior called out to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today was the day we took the prototype to the client.<BR>
I'd tested it thoroughly earlier, so I'd be able to show them something good.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
We headed for the usual company car.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\社用車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The wind was a little strong today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wind... come to think of it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, don't ride in the company car today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remembered <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE>'s words.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Let's take a taxi today. Finding pay parking around there was a pain."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? But that'll cost a lot. Accounting's gonna chew us out!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Then let's take the bus. One should be coming about now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\商談.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE>, couldn't you make it a little lighter?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The client said it so casually, but this was actually a pretty tough problem.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"But as you know, this version only changes the design from the previous one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">If we tried to make it lighter, we would need to change the parts, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, then you'd need a full-scale prototype..."<PG>
Normally, a phone prototype is a machine bigger than a refrigerator.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Turning that into semiconductors costs hundreds of millions of yen in development.<PG>
This design-variant model had been planned to avoid that <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="ばくだい">enormous</STYLE> development cost.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, since the semiconductors were being reused, changing the parts was difficult.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or so an amateur would think.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For what it's worth, I had a professional's pride, so I meant to meet the client's requests as far as I could.<PG>
"But hmm... 
{PAUSE ""}
I really think a difference in weight from before, when you hold it in your hand, would make quite an impression..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's certainly true..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To tell the truth, I had already predicted the client would make that request.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was one more prototype sitting on my desk at the office.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was exactly the piece I'd been improving in anticipation of the client's request.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Understood. How about the day after tomorrow? I could bring you a lighter prototype by then."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That soon!? You can change the parts!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"No, it's just a small improvement. Well, please leave it to us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Wow, that's <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE> for you. You're a lifesaver!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Then I'll come by again the day after tomorrow, Thursday, April 8."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\バス車内.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE>, you're amazing! You predicted what they'd say and made the next prototype already!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the bus home, my junior was buttering me up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"What matters is always thinking from the user's point of view. It's pretty hard, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, when you think like a developer, you always end up wrapping it up with 'it can't be helped.'"<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Hm...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Through the window, I saw a car that had crashed into a utility pole.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was...!
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the company car we'd been about to take.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\事故車.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It looked like a single-car accident. The driver's seat was bent a little, the passenger seat badly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The driver seemed to be all right, but one wrong move and it would have been worse than a serious injury.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE>'s words came back to me again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "50"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\罅（ひび）\桜3.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供血バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Ever since the accident in Central Park, a strange ability that worked only at this time of year had awakened in <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An ability to foresee danger to people. It seemed to work when she was in the wind.<PG>
But we hadn't told <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE> about the wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because if she was in the wind for more than 15 minutes, she would fall ill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we told her, she might even come to fear the wind.<PG>
And between <STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE> and me there was an unspoken rule: we always listened to <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE>'s warnings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What started it was, of course, that time.<PG>
When that accident happened―when <STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro</STYLE> fell, a strong wind was raging.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cherry blossoms and the wind from that day had probably become <STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE>'s trauma.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could understand why cherry blossoms and wind made her ill, but why an ability like that...<PG>
Come to think of it, there was a strange sound back then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sound rang out at almost the same moment <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro</STYLE> fell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth was that sound―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\バス車内.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE>, what's up? You're spacing out."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ah, no... it's nothing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed my junior hadn't noticed the crash into the utility pole.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's rare for <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE> to space out. Well, it's spring, so you get sleepy."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yeah, you're right. Haha, spring sure makes you sleepy."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\作業机.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"All right, done!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The prototype to take to the client the day after tomorrow was finished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd made it even lighter than the client had asked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if they said they needed new parts, I'd show them I could finish it to their request in no time.<PG>
"Whoa... <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE>, you really are amazing!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"What are you talking about! You're the one who made the base design, right? I just adjusted it to match."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, no, I could never customize it like this... 
{PAUSE ""}
For the software side too, you don't need to rely on the software department anymore, do you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Haha, no way. Programs, apps... just looking at a coding screen makes me sick."</STYLE><PG>
Software is an important selling point of phones these days, but this was as far as I could go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the people in the software department were good. Apparently they designed things to run without program changes even if some of the hardware was swapped out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was just riding on that and getting fussed over by my junior.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, you take this by yourself the day after tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I handed the freshly finished prototype to my junior.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? M-me, by myself!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"You've got the design in your head, right? Just explain it slowly and carefully, and that'll be plenty."</STYLE><PG>
I'd send this guy alone to deliver the prototype the day after tomorrow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would be his first time, but it was something he'd need sooner or later.<PG>
"G-got it! I'll do my best!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Good, that's the spirit!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, my junior began checking the design and the specs again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He had designed the basics himself anyway, so it wouldn't be much work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked like everyone could go home on time today.
